  "rationale": "Block fileServer:lateralMovement, dbLogin:authenticate and printServer:lateralMovement. Blocking fileServer cuts codeRepo and one route to mailArchive. Blocking dbLogin cuts jumpHost, which removes shareMount and the other mailArchive route. Without dbLogin, secretsManager and serviceAccount also fail, so vaultRead has no route there. Blocking printServer removes the last route to vaultRead. Two blocks cannot work, because three independent requirements exist. fileServer must be cut, since sshKey is reachable from many entries. The jumpHost/dbLogin chain must be cut. The printServer chain must be cut, since memoryDump comes directly from entries. No single step covers two of these."
